constraint = "The legacy trace subsequently sums every full canonical state in commit.rs, outside scope, so adjusting only its peak estimate cannot admit the required greater-than-64-MiB full-state proof. The unchanged semantic witness duplicates the 4096-byte seed in host and storage baseline preimages at every boundary; 65 seven-operator reads alone require at least 3727360 seed bytes, above the fixed 1048576-byte witness limit."
assumption = "Preserve all existing guards, witness encodings, seed and rollback assertions, and the required host-call count above 64. Resolving the legacy trace representation requires an explicit contract decision; no check is disabled and no test is weakened."
evidence_reference = "Build, all dependent checks, and verification at this revision are recorded by reference to /out/run/gates.jsonl and /out/logs/build-1.log, /out/logs/dependents-1.log, /out/logs/verify-1.log. This record is appended after the failed gate and does not claim qualification of a later candidate."

